{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13516","headline":"赠史修文 · 沈千运","name":"赠史修文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人阻千里，会面非别期。\n握手於此地，当欢反成悲。\n念离宛犹昨，俄已经数期。\n畴昔皆少年，别来鬓如丝。\n不道旧姓名，相逢知是谁。\n曩游尽骞翥，与君仍布衣。\n岂曰无其才，命理应有时。\n别路渐欲少，不觉生涕洟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈千运","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}